  Cmn1=AandH Mute Control-AHM64 r0.0\\\\Controls Input, Zone and Group||1
  Cmn2=Mutes.\\\\Parameters:\\ ControlType: Select Input, Zone or Group.
  Cmn3=\\ ControlChnl: Select valid range from control type in decimal||1
  Cmn4=format.\\\\Inputs:\\ Digital-\\  MuteOn/Off/Toggle: Pulse to turn||1
  Cmn5=mute on/off or toggle state.\\	Poll: Pulse to poll and sync the||1
  Cmn6=current level. Should only be needed for initial \\			reading of||1
  Cmn7=level at code start or after recalling a preset. Module will poll\\
  Cmn8=			internally for other changes.\\\\ Serial-\\  FmMixer: Connect||1
  Cmn9=to the TCP/IP symbol receive line.\\\\Outputs:\\ Digital-\\  MuteOnFb/OffFb:
  Cmn10=||1Mute Feedback. This is tracked internally\\   by the module. It||1
  Cmn11=is also updated when the mixer sends\\   feedback when the control||1
  Cmn12=is nudged.\\\\ Serial-\\  ToMixer: Connect to the TCP/IP symbol||1
  Cmn13=Transmit line.\\\\Notes:\\ Reference the AHM64 protocol for valid||1
  Cmn14=Control Channels for the\\  selected control type.\\\\ For more||1
  Cmn15=information Reference: AHM-TCP-Protocol-V1.pdf\\\\ Tested with AHM64||1
  Cmn16=Firmware V1.02 - Rev59154\\\\ Release: 2020-Nov-19 Release r0.0\\
[END]
